same-zone-history.patch preserves pull history across repeated zone announcements.
The build applies it in a private source worktree until the engine fork includes it.

telesto-response-deadline.patch bounds complete Telesto responses and cancels
HTTP exchanges when their deadline or delivery permit expires. It includes the
native TelestoHttpRegressionTest suite. Both build scripts and the release gate
apply it in the same private source worktree. Move it into CateDesu/event-trigger
on main when publishing the fork fix, then update both engine pins. No fork
commit is required to build or distribute the patched host jar.

The older crash and arrow guards were retired 2026-09-05 and live in
CateDesu/event-trigger on main. They remain as rollback references.
